    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ja kūding'wa mu shikū ja kū būtongi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa aho wanamhalala wakwīja ī myaka ya būlamu, ū SEEBA ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū bebe wakūlaga ī haha, alīyo ītaalī īlīho sī ngalī no ī ya kūding'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īyo ītaalī kūding'wa yīyī: Py'a mabbaala ga Bafilisiti na a ga Bageshuli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwandīja kū mongo gwa Shihooli, kīya ya Misili, kūja sukuma kū lūbīmbī lwa Ekuloni, ī sī yose yenīyo ītaalī yūbalwa kūbiza ya Bakanaani, (alīyo ī sī ya Bafilisiti, īkwikalīlagwa na basugi batanò mu mizengo ya, Gaza, Ashidodi, Ashikeloni, Gaasi, na Ekuloni; ī yose yenīyo ībalilwe gīkī ya Bakanaani); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū kūfuma ī dakama, pyī ī sī ya Bakanaani, kwīngīīla Alaba ya banhū ba Sidoni kūjūshika Afeki, kū sī ya Baamooli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī libbaala lya Bagebali, nī Lebanoni ī yose kūja kīya, kūfuma Baali-gadi kū ntulumenho gwa lūgūlū lwa Helimoni, kūjūshika kū nzīla ya Hamasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abo bakikalaga mu sī ja maalūgūlū, kwandīja mhandī ja Lebanoni kūja Misilefoti-maini, hū kūhaya pye a Basidoni, a bene nakūbīnja nene ū kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli. Gwike ū bebe ītīnagūlage dūhū ī sī yenīyo kūlwa wingīji wa a Baisilaeli gīt'ūmo naakūlagīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūkwīgabanhya ū kū ng'anda ījo kenda nī nusu ya lūganda lwa Manase, bapandīke ū wingīji wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ipandī lya kīya ya Yolodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nusu ī yīngī ī ya lūganda lwa Manase baamala kwanukūla ū wingīji wabo hamò na banhū ba lūganda lwa Lubeni na lwa Gaadi. Ū Musa ū ntūmami o ng'wa SEBA wamala kūbinha ū kū kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani, gīt'ūmo wei ng'wenekīlī akabahelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī lyenīlo līkūbanīgije mabbaala ga kwandīja Aloe, kūshisha kū lūgegu lwa mongo gwa Alinoni; na kūfuma kū nzengo ūyo gūlī ha gatī gatī ya ntubīlo gwa mongo gwenūyo, nī mbūga ya Madeba pyī ī yose kūshisha Diboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nī mizengo ī yose īyo yalī ya ng'wa Sihoni ntemi wa Baamooli, ūyo ikūlū lyakwe lyaalī Heshiboni, bbihī na lūbīmbī lwa Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī Gileadi īlīmo ū ng'wibbaala lyenīlo, ī sī ya banhū ba Geshuli na Maaka; nū lūgūlū ū lose ū lwa Helimoni nī Bashani ī yose, kūjūshika Saleka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hū kūhaya pyī ī sī ya Bashani, īyo yalī mu būtemi o ng'wa Ogi, ūyo wikalo w'ikūlū lyakwe walī Ashtalooti na Edilei. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī ūmò wa Balefai abo baalī baashiigīīla; abo Musa akabapyena wīsola ī sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a Baisilaeli bakaleka ū kūbapeeja a banhū ba Geshuli na a ba Maaka, hū kūhaya nī lelo īy'a banhū babo bakwikalaga hamò na a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba lūganda lwa Lawī atabinhile ū wingīji, nguno ī shakwinha sha kūpemva īsho shikafunyiwagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, shilī wingīji wabo, gīt'ūmo wabisagīīgīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya lūganda lo Lubeni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī h'ī sī īyo Musa akabinha banhū ba lūganda lwa Lubeni, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja Aloe kūshisha kū lūgegu lwa mongo gwa Alinoni, na kūfuma kū nzengo ūyo gwalī ha gatī gatī ya ntubīlo gwa mongo gwenūyo; nī mbūga ya Madeba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūshisha Heshiboni nī mizengo ī yose ī ya mu mbūga yenīyo; yūkūbanījiwa nī Diboni, Bamosi-baali, Beti-baali-meoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahazi, Kedemoti, Mefaati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiliataimu, Sibuma, Zeleti-shaha, īyo īlī ha kaalūgūlū mu sī ya ntubīlo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beet-peoli, nī mitulumenho ya lūgūlū lwa Pisiga, nī Beet-yeshimoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī mizengo ī yose ī ya mu mbūga yenīyo, nī sī īyo yalī ya ng'wa Sihoni ntemi wa Baamooli, ūyo ikūlū lyakwe lyaalī Heshiboni. Ū Musa akampyena hamò na a batwale",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Batwale:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu shikū ja būsugi wa batemi, ū ntwaale, walī nsugi wa si ha sīlīlī ya ntemi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ba Bamidiani ba, Evi, Lekemu, Zūūli, Hūūli na Leba; nabo a benabo baalī basugi, nīyo baalī na banwani biiye ū Sihoni, na bikalaga ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaamu ū nchūūja, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beoli; nang'hwe a Baisilaeli bakamūlaga bo līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwa banhū ba lūganda lwa Lubeni lwalī lūshikile a ha lūgegu lwa mongo gwa Yolodani. Ī mizengo yenīyo hamò na a magūngūli gayo hū walī wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa Lubeni, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya lūganda lo Gaadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī h'ī sī īyo Musa akabinha banhū ba lūganda lwa Gaadi, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja Yazeeli; pyī ī mizengo ya mu Gileadi nī nusu ya sī ya Baamoni kūshisha Aloe bbihī na Laba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kūfuma Heshimoni kūshisha Lamati-misipa na Betonimu; na kūfuma Mahanaimu kūshisha kū sī ya Debili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī sī y'inyalala; nī mizengo ya Beti-halani, Beti-nimula, Sukoti, na Zafoni, īyo yalī yasaagīīla kū būtemi o ng'wa Sihoni, ū ntemi wa Heshiboni (ī sī īyo īlī lwandī lwa kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani, īyo ījile yūūkakuumīla ha Nyanza ya Galilaya). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mizengo yenīyī na a magūngūli gayo hū yalī sī ya wingīji wa banhū ba lūganda lwa Gaadi, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sī ya lūganda lo Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īyī h'ī sī īyo Musa akabinha banhū ba nusu ya lūganda lo Manase; ī nusu ya shibyalīlwe sha numba ya ng'wa Manase, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī yene yalī īkūbanīgije mapandī ga kwandīja Mahanaimu nī Bashani ī yose, pyī ī sī īyo yalī īsugilwe na Ogi ntemi wa Bashani; nī mizengo pyī ī ya ng'wipandī lya Yaili ū mu sī ya Bashani, īlī mizengo makūmi atandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī nusu ya Gileadi, hamò nī mizengo ya Ashitalooti na Edilei (mizengo y'ikūlū lya ng'wa Ogi ū mu Bashani). Ī sī yenīyo bakinhwa banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Makili ng'witūnja o ng'wa Manase, gīkī ībize wingīji wa nusu ya banhū ba lūganda lwa Makili, gīt'ūmo būdūgū wabo walī būlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wingīji wa Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wenūbū hū ū wingīji gīt'ūmo Musa akabagabanhīja aho ataalī nabo a Baisilaeli mu mbūga ja Moabu, kū nkīlo gwa Yolodani, kīya ya nzengo gwa Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Musa atabinhile wingīji bose bose a Balawī, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli hū ng'wene alī wingīji wabo, gīt'ūmo wabisagīīgīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
